<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IBM EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IBM EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said it trimmed its first quarter earnings estimates on International Business Machines Corp to $2.32 a share from $2.64, and cut its full-year 1997 estimate to $12.43 from $13.</p>
<p>-- cited continued strength of the dollar against foreign currencies and the continuation of weak dynamic random access memory (DRAM) chip pricing.</p>
<p>-- reiterated outperform rating on stock.</p>
<p>-- IBM was up 1/8 to 146-1/4.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
